── growth_proximity_weight CURVE (growth lane, n=1186) ──
  SLOPE of the distance-below-own-high dock: score ×(1 + w·(range_pct/100 − 1)).
  1.0 = SHIPPED (raw multiply: a name at 80% of range keeps 0.80 of its score, one at the high keeps 1.00).
  0.0 = term OFF (everyone ×1.00). NEGATIVE = INVERTED — the name furthest below its high scores HIGHEST
  (at −1.0 the 80%-of-range name is multiplied by 1.20). Clamped at 0, so no rung can produce a negative factor.
